{
  "sequence_id": "seq_f164203a45862778",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "...right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "mmm..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Okay. It's hard, but I can touch the fish."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If I cut it,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "BUT..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "THEN..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It'll have blood spraying every- where!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It'll be like Waaaa-hhh!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Blood's the one thing I can't deal with!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "How many one things you can't deal with are there!!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Okay then..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I didn't want to have to resort to this..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "But I don't have a choice..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The next day"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I did all as Hainigas"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "the original"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Mawia"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "This is my big sister's prized stash."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If you can make it through these slacher movies, one or two fish will be nothing!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh, I see!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I don't like scary stuff either..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "But I can't just leave you here, so I'll stay..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Sorry..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...It's coming."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There's gonna be blood every- where!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "eeeee! it's heeeke!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "!!.,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T16",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You're not moving at all, Presi- dent?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "This is a lot easier than I thought it'd be."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "That's because you're not looking!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Don't cover your eyes!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I'm scared too!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You're the whole reason we're doing this, so you can't cover your eyes!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Huh!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Look, my eyes are wide open!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Just like a fish!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Then keep them that way!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Don't close them an inch!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And so..."
    }
  ],
